es appear.\n2. When you select an answer choice, the situation described in the passage is output as audio and text.\n3. Place the correct answer inside the circle.\n4. Solve the quiz.\n5. Use the staple remover to remove staples attached to the paper.\n6. Discard the removed staples in the trash can and place the paper in the recycled paper bin.\n7. Pick up the knife and scissors inside the box. Picking up an item stored normally changes it to an abnormal state. Picking up an item in an abnormal state changes it to a normal state.\n8. Return all items inside the box to their normal state.\n9. Grab the utility knife and cut the tape starting from the end of the box.\n10. Grab the broom and dustpan.\n11. Glass shards appear with the sound of breaking glass at a random location.\n12. Use the broom and dustpan to clean up as many glass shards as possible within the time limit.", "short_description": "This VR program trains participants to safely handle sharp tools and office supplies through quizzes and hands-on practice. By simulating scenarios like using staple removers and cleaning broken glass, users repeatedly reinforce essential habits to prevent puncture and cut injuries."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDA Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_i